# TU5, TU8: an array function does not take an unboxed tuple.
== SOURCE
2 r_eshape (1, 2)
== ERROR
error[type-mismatch]: expected an array, found a tuple
 --> -e:1:1
  |
1 | 2 r_eshape (1, 2)
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  | - a whole-number literal, here an Int
  = note: `r_eshape` has type Int -> a -> a
